58 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/T(At Sri Easwari Scientific Solution Pvt Ltd \(SESS\), we are committed to providing advanced testing  solutions for the rapidly evolving energy storage industry. Our Battery Test Chambers are designed to  meet the stringent requirements for testing lithium-ion and other energy storage systems, ensuring safety,  reliability and performance.)/E(At Sri Easwari Scientific Solution Pvt Ltd \(SESS\), we are committed to providing advanced testing  solutions for the rapidly evolving energy storage industry. Our Battery Test Chambers are designed to  meet the stringent requirements for testing lithium-ion and other energy storage systems, ensuring safety,  reliability and performance.)/Pg 8 0 R/K[6]>>
