61 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H4/T(    Electric Vehicles \(EVs\) Test battery packs and modules for durability, safety, and performance.     Renewable Energy Storage Validate the reliability and efficiency of batteries used in solar and wind  energy systems.     Consumer Electronics Ensure the safety and longevity of batteries in smartphones, laptops, and other  electronic devices.     Industrial Applications  Test batteries used in industrial machinery and equipment for consistent  performance under various conditions.     International Standards Covered IEC 62660 , UL 1642, UN 38.3 , SAE J2464 , ISO 12405)/E(    Electric Vehicles \(EVs\) Test battery packs and modules for durability, safety, and performance.     Renewable Energy Storage Validate the reliability and efficiency of batteries used in solar and wind  energy systems.     Consumer Electronics Ensure the safety and longevity of batteries in smartphones, laptops, and other  electronic devices.     Industrial Applications  Test batteries used in industrial machinery and equipment for consistent  performance under various conditions.     International Standards Covered IEC 62660 , UL 1642, UN 38.3 , SAE J2464 , ISO 12405)/Pg 8 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

