68 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(    Safety Assurance Simulate extreme conditions to ensure battery safety, including thermal runaway and  fire propagation tests.     Performance Validation Test battery capacity, cycle life, and efficiency under different environmental  conditions.     Precise Control  Advanced PLC control systems with HMI provide accurate and repeatable test results.     Comprehensive Data Logging  Extensive data logging capabilities for detailed analysis and reporting.     Customization Chamber scan be tailored to meet specific testing requirements and protocols.     Enhanced Reliability  Identify potential issues early in the development process to improve battery  design and performance.)/E(    Safety Assurance Simulate extreme conditions to ensure battery safety, including thermal runaway and  fire propagation tests.     Performance Validation Test battery capacity, cycle life, and efficiency under different environmental  conditions.     Precise Control  Advanced PLC control systems with HMI provide accurate and repeatable test results.     Comprehensive Data Logging  Extensive data logging capabilities for detailed analysis and reporting.     Customization Chamber scan be tailored to meet specific testing requirements and protocols.     Enhanced Reliability  Identify potential issues early in the development process to improve battery  design and performance.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

