<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(Our Battery Test Chambers are engineered to ensure the highest level of safety during testing. One of the critical features is the  hazard level, designed specifically to mitigate any risk of an explosive atmosphere within the chamber. This ensures a safe  testing environment, even under extreme conditions.)/E(Our Battery Test Chambers are engineered to ensure the highest level of safety during testing. One of the critical features is the  hazard level, designed specifically to mitigate any risk of an explosive atmosphere within the chamber. This ensures a safe  testing environment, even under extreme conditions.)/Pg 9 0 R/K[8]>>
