99 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Secure access points are provided through portholes with retaining  clamps. These portholes allow for the introduction or removal of test samples without  compromising the chamber's environment. )/Pg 10 0 R/K[25]>>
endobj

