110 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(This system ensures a rapid response in case of fire. The CO2 protection  system can quickly flood the chamber with carbon dioxide to extinguish flames, while the  water mist predisposition allows for the integration of a water mist system. Both methods  provide effective fire suppression, protecting both the equipment and personnel.)/Pg 11 0 R/K[9]>>
