<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/T(This attention to construction details not only underscores the chamber's durability and functionality but also its aesthetic appeal.)/E(This attention to construction details not only underscores the chamber's durability and functionality but also its aesthetic appeal.)/Pg 14 0 R/K[32]>>
endobj

