231 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(8)/Pg 15 0 R/K[0]>>
endobj

232 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(In our climatic test chamber's air circulation system, we incorporate the following components and features:)/E(In our climatic test chamber's air circulation system, we incorporate the following components and features:)/Pg 15 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

233 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(1.Fan/Blower: The chamber is equipped with a fan or blower featuring a continuous-duty rated motor. This motor efficiently circulates air within the chamber.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

234 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(2.Conditioning Space: Inside the main chamber, there's a dedicated conditioning area with baffles, housing essential components like heaters and cooling coils. These elements play a crucial role in air conditioning.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

235 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(3.Uniform Temperature: Conditioned air is introduced into the main chamber to ensure consistent temperature distribution throughout the workspace, maintaining a stable temperature environment during tests.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

236 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(4.Laminar Airflow: The chamber is designed for laminar airflow, achieved using a fan motor and impeller with an appropriate capacity. This setup guarantees even distribution of temperature and humidity within the chamber, adhering to specified limits.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

237 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(5.Motor Shaft: TC/ETC - The motor shaft used for chamber air circulation is constructed with SS 304 without any joints. The motor is positioned outside the chamber, while an extended-length SS 304 shaft drives the fans. This design ensures smooth and reliable operation while preserving the chamber's internal environment.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

238 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(ATC/AETC - "The mechanical design of the chamber's air circulation motor is constructed with a sturdy shaft connected by a flexible coupling. The inner shaft is made of SS 304 material and is connected to the blower drum, which features a double vacuum seal mechanism.\216)/Pg 15 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

239 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 37 0 R/Pg 15 0 R/K[13]>>
endobj

240 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(6.Motor Winding: For high-temperature chambers, we utilize motor windings of H class, whereas for chambers operating below 130\260C, F class motor windings are employed.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

241 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(These features combine to create an efficient and precise air circulation system within the climatic test chamber, facilitating accurate and dependable test conditions for various experiments and applications.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

242 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(Inconel-type Air heaters with PTFE wire and silicon end cap.)/E(Inconel-type Air heaters with PTFE wire and silicon end cap.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

243 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(The chamber is equipped with sealed Inconel tube heaters to maintain a uniform temperature. These heaters are meticulously designed to ensure even heat distribution throughout the chamber. Heat input is regulated by solid-state relays, controlled through a PID controller programmer. )/Pg 15 0 R/K[16]>>
endobj

244 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(One notable advantage of inconel tube heaters is their exceptional ability to withstand high temperatures and corrosive environments. Inconel, known for its outstanding durability and heat resistance, is well-suited for prolonged use in challenging conditions.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[17]>>
endobj

245 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 37 0 R/Pg 15 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

246 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Compared to stainless steel heaters, inconel heaters exhibit superior resistance to oxidation, corrosion, and high-temperature degradation. They are engineered to deliver reliable and efficient heat transfer without direct radiation onto the test item, ensuring a uniform heating process that doesn't adversely affect the test specimen. )/Pg 15 0 R/K[18]>>
endobj

247 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(In conclusion, the use of sealed inconel tube heaters is highly recommended for maintaining precise and uniform chamber temperatures while ensuring the performance of the heating system.)/Pg 15 0 R/K[19]>>
endobj

248 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(www.sess.in)/Pg 15 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

249 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(@sesschennai)/Pg 15 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

250 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(sesschennai.blogspot.com)/Pg 15 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

