<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 38 0 R/Pg 16 0 R>>
endobj

252 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(Refrigeration System Based on Model Selected)/E(Refrigeration System Based on Model Selected)/Pg 16 0 R/K[13]>>
