endobj

254 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 38 0 R/Pg 16 0 R/K[1]>>
endobj

255 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 38 0 R/Pg 16 0 R/K[2]>>
endobj

256 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(9)/Pg 16 0 R/K[3]>>
endobj

257 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(For single-stage configurations, the system features either air or water-cooled refrigeration, incorporating a Hermetic compressor from Embraco, Danfoss, or Emerson, or a semi-hermetic compressor from Bitzer, Dorin, or Bock. These compressors operate with the environmentally friendly refrigerant R404A. The system includes essential safety features such as HP/LP cut-off switches, air inlet condensers/temperature protectors, backup fuse protection, expansion valves, and is engineered for continuous and trouble-free operation.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[14]>>
endobj

258 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(For double-stage cascade configurations, the system comprises either air or water-cooled refrigeration, equipped with a Hermetic compressor from Embraco or Danfoss, or a semi-hermetic compressor from Bitzer, Dorin, Bock, or Emerson. These compressors utilize environmentally friendly refrigerants R404A and R23. Safety features such as HP/LP cut-off switches, air inlet condensers/temperature protectors, backup fuse protection, expansion valves are included, ensuring continuous and trouble-free operation.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[15]>>
endobj

259 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H1/T(Our chamber's refrigeration system is designed for optimal performance, with variations in specifications based on different models.)/E(Our chamber's refrigeration system is designed for optimal performance, with variations in specifications based on different models.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[16]>>
endobj

260 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 38 0 R/Pg 16 0 R/K[17]>>
endobj

261 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/Figure/P 38 0 R/Pg 16 0 R/K[18]>>
endobj

262 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Single-stage compressor for temperatures up to -40\260C, and a double-stage compressor for temperatures below -70\260C. We select our compressors from reputable brands like Bitzer, Dorin, Bock, Danfoss, SECOP, or Embraco.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

263 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Environmentally friendly refrigerants are used, with R404A for single-compressor systems and R404A/R23 for cascade systems.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

264 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(Safety features include HP/LP cut-off switches, pressure transmitters for continuous monitoring, and suction line temperature sensors for enhanced safety.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

265 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(The system can have a water or air-cooled condenser based on the model. Temperature monitoring and safety limits are integrated into our PLC system for effective control and protection.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[10]>>
endobj

266 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(The compressor and condenser unit are positioned below the chamber for optimal performance.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[11]>>
endobj

267 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(For condenser cooling, our PLC system monitors the air or water inlet temperature. If it exceeds 26\260C \(water\) or 40\260C \(air\), a safety alarm triggers, and chamber operation stops until the temperature returns to normal, which can be adjusted through HMI and PC software. )/Pg 16 0 R/K[12]>>
endobj

268 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(www.sess.in)/Pg 16 0 R/K[4]>>
endobj

269 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(@sesschennai)/Pg 16 0 R/K[5]>>
endobj

270 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/P/ActualText(sesschennai.blogspot.com)/Pg 16 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

